DataDirectory /var/lib/tor-directory
SocksPort 127.0.0.1:29050
ControlPort 127.0.0.1:29051
CookieAuthentication 1
CookieAuthFile /var/lib/tor-directory/control_auth_cookie
HiddenServiceDir /var/lib/tor-directory/hidden_service
HiddenServiceVersion 3
HiddenServicePort 80 127.0.0.1:18080
AvoidDiskWrites 1
Log notice stdout
